    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> designed and delivered a project for a 48 m² apartment: interior design, a turnkey renovation, custom furniture, and decorating."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The goal was to make a small apartment comfortable to live in and to use every square meter."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The furniture was custom-made to the room dimensions, which gave the apartment the storage it needed while keeping the interior in a unified style."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The studio managed the project from the concept and documentation to the renovation, furniture installation, and final decorating — which is why the finished interior matches the design project."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "Below are photos of the finished interior and the custom-made furniture."
      }
